  "canonicalReference": "@threadplane/langgraph!LangGraphThreadsAdapter:class",
  "isDeprecated": false,
  "isTypeOnly": false,
  "summary": "SDK-backed thread store. Wraps `client.threads.*` and maps SDK\nthreads to the framework's [Thread](/docs/api/chat/Thread) type for direct use with\n`<chat-thread-list>` / `<chat-sidenav>`.\n\nConsumers wire the framework's `ThreadActionAdapter` to instance\nmethods (rename/delete/archive/pin/...) so the right-click menu\nround-trips through the LangGraph SDK without per-app boilerplate.",
  "declarations": [
